     INTER was entered as a negative number.
  Intermediate output is written to JOUT in ASCII format
 Printing starts in cycle...........           1

 Intermediate printout intervals of           4 cycles
 Intermediate printout intervals of.        2.00 minutes

 Summary printout intervals of......           4 cycles
 Summary printout time interval of..        2.00 minutes

 Hot start file parameter (JREDO)...           0

 Initial time (TZERO)...............        0.00 hours
 This is time displacement from JIN interface file starting date/time when
 interface file is used.
 This also describes starting hour in K3 line hydrograph input when K3
 lines are used.
 Initial date (default).............        19880101 (yr/mo/day)
 NOTE: Initial date from JIN interface file will be used, if accessed,
 unless IDATZ is negative.

 Iteration variables: ITMAX.........      10
                      SURTOL........  0.7500
                      Surjun........  0.2000
                      Node Tolerance  1.0000
                      Link Omega....  0.7500
                      Node Omega....  4.0000

 Default surface area of junctions....   12.57 square feet.

 SEMI-IMPLICIT EXTRAN SOLUTION. (ISOL = 1).
